:;(First interaction)
:::'''Celine:''' Ah, ah, ah, ah! La, la, la, la!
:::'''Celine:''' Sorry, I didn't notice there were people around. I'm not disturbing you, am I?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You have a great voice.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I wasn't bothered at all.
:::'''Celine:''' Okay, I shall continue warming up my voice... Oh, no! The play isn't open to the public yet. I'd better not spoil it. I am so forgetful!
:::'''Celine:''' Anyway, the play is still in rehearsal. I'm the leading.... actress' voice. If you like the song, we can meet again in the theater.
:;(Subsequent interactions)
:::'''Celine:''' He said that my strings stirred his heart, and to that tune, his flute played all through the night.
:::'''Celine:''' I can feel something deep in the harmony... I know I'm still young, but I'm sure he's the one... la la la...
:::'''Celine:''' Huh. Are you here for my singing again? That won't do. You need to enjoy the performance in the theater... Or are you here for something else?
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Celine's recent troubles...
:::'''Celine:''' I'm happy with my lot at the moment, dubbing voices for Tamila and being her shadow. What's wrong with that?
:::'''Celine:''' But yeah... I can't help thinking sometimes how wonderful it must be to stand in that spotlight like Tamila... how wonderful it must feel...
:::'''Celine:''' So I've been watching Tamila's sparkling on-stage performances, like a painter copying a famous painting, trying to copy everything Tamila does...
:::'''Celine:''' But! Even though I can perfectly emulate all of Tamila's behaviors, I'm still lacking that key piece of her soul...
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Soul?
:::'''Celine:''' Yeah, soul... my mimicry's already pretty much perfect, but the presence and gravitas contained in all those micro-expressions is something I haven't been able to master...
:::'''Celine:''' I know that anyone can just copy her body as long as you practice hard enough... but I'll need to copy her soul if I want to truly become Tamila.
:::'''Celine:''' Can you help me?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Stealing souls is black magic, and forbidden...
::::'''Celine:''' Oh dear. No! I'm not a witch. Why would you say it like that?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How can I help you?
::::'''Celine:''' Well... don't worry. It's not a difficult job~
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then I will do my best!
::::'''Celine:''' Ah, that makes me so happy! Thank you~
:::'''Celine:''' I would like you to visit the store where Tamila often goes and ask the staff in secret what Tamila's likes and hobbies are beyond the limelight.
:::'''Celine:''' Perhaps if I can learn what those are, then I can understand a bit more about Tamila's soul.
:::'''Celine:''' And with that, I'll be able to be like Tamila and shine brightly onstage.
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Can't you just go yourself?
::::'''Celine:''' I'm just studying to be like her because she's my idol. It'll be super awkward if any of the staff catches me~
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why don't I just ask her directly?
::::'''Celine:''' No, don't... she's a smart lady. If you ask her so suddenly and directly, she'll definitely know what I'm up to... *sigh* My passion is a fire that has to burn in secret~
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where should I go for you?
::::'''Celine:''' Go to the florist first~ I heard Tamila buys a few bouquets of flowers every week for her room... *sigh* how elegant~!
::::'''Celine:''' The florist definitely knows the kind of flowers that she likes~ Please, find out for me~
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Relaying Vaska's reply...
:::'''Celine:''' Rainbows... interesting~ For someone as glorious as Tamila, her floral preference is so... "ordinarily beautiful."
:::'''Celine:''' I thought that she'd definitely buy some precious rare flowers instead, to match her noble self... But actually, there is this craving and desire in her soul...
:::'''Celine:''' Thank you! I feel a little bit closer to her soul, now. Please, take this as a thank-you.
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Everything going well?
:::'''Celine:''' Yeah~ Actually it's been going really well~ Since you gave me that precious intel about Tamila, I felt... closer and closer to her...
:::'''Celine:''' I'm starting to feel the mystery surrounding her is gradually becoming clearer to me...
:::'''Celine:''' But... it's obviously not enough... I remember Miss Vaska was saying that Tamila and her have different tastes in novels... then, maybe her taste in fiction can showcase a little more of her soul?
:::'''Celine:''' Can you help me out with one more favor? Go to the bookstore over in the Administrative District and ask if Tamila has any favorite books...
:::'''Celine:''' Please~
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Relay Fizz's reply...
:::'''Celine:''' It's no surprise that Tamila would love a romance novel...
:::'''Celine:''' But I've never read this particular one. Your intel is highly useful. Thank you~
:::'''Celine:''' Maybe hidden within this novel are Tamila's secret thoughts about love...
:::'''Celine:''' Thanks lots for helping me with this! Take this as a token of my appreciation~
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Everything going well?
:::'''Celine:''' Thanks to you, things are getting better and better~ I'm getting a clearer picture of Tamila's soul.
:::'''Celine:''' That novel ''Evening Ember at the Goethe Hotel''... to be honest, I'm not sure I really get it completely...
:::'''Celine:''' But I'll make sure that I fall in love with this novel~
:::'''Celine:''' I've been thinking about what Tamila said that time to Fizz back at the store... "It's such a blessing to read this book over and over again in a cozy warm bedroom with my flowers."
:::'''Celine:''' Maybe a warm bedroom is the crucial piece of the puzzle here~
:::'''Celine:''' A few days back, I heard Tamila complaining backstage that her heater at home is broken. That being the case, she'll definitely go to the workshop to get it fixed.
:::'''Celine:''' Please, can you go and ask at the workshop what level Tamila turns her heater up to?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's... starting to get a little too personal.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Will Serval even answer this kind of question?
:::'''Celine:''' Just go and ask for me~ If you can't, it's okay and I won't blame you. But please~
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Relay Serval's reply...
:::'''Celine:''' You couldn't get the info? No, this is far more intel than I ever could have imagined. Thank you so much~
:::'''Celine:''' Based on Serval's story, Tamila dragged the heater to the workshop all by herself~ No servants, assistants, or a manager helping her out &mdash; just her dragging it herself...
:::'''Celine:''' So that's what Tamila's soul is like... I'm gradually coming to comprehensively understand everything about her...
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't quite get it...
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you mean by Tamila's soul?
:::'''Celine:''' Ah, sorry~ I was talking to myself again. I didn't mean to confuse you~
:::'''Celine:''' I just think that this whole time, I've just been really shallow about what I've learned from Tamila. What I really need to mimic from her soul is hidden in her everyday life offstage.
:::'''Celine:''' It's not her character and performance onstage that shape her unique soul, but rather it's her offstage everyday love for life that makes her so precious and dazzling~
:::'''Celine:''' Thank you. Starting today, I can finally become the second Tamila. This reminds me of the lyrics of a beautiful song~
:::'''Celine:''' "Madam~ madam~ that shadow behind you has gone~ but I see your reflection~ still in the mirror~"
:;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Everything going well?
:::'''Celine:''' Thanks to you~ everything's going great. I can already see my dazzling figure on stage... One day, I'm going to be just like her...
:::'''Celine:''' Speaking of which &mdash; can you please help me out with just one little thing?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Go on.
::::'''Celine:''' All this intel you've brought me is fantastic, but it's still second-hand info... and by the time it reaches me, it's already third-hand...
::::'''Celine:''' Could you please go and see for yourself how Tamila looks when she's offstage?
::::'''Celine:''' I heard that she's going to buy some more books today. Please, can you go to the bookstore and observe how she buys her books? Thank you so much~
::::----
